# Model access tokens a creator pasted (#9). Never committed.
.sage/model-api-credentials.json
# Real rows from a Data Source, shown to the agent because the creator asked (#16). Never committed:
# the rest of .sage/ rides into the published app's container, which is right for column names and
# wrong for production data.
.sage/samples.json
# Chat-local files. They persist on this volume and do not travel with git.
.sage/scratch/
.sage/chat-work/
# The stop button's private content store (TurnSnapshot). Builder-local scratch, like the two
# above. It is a git repo inside this one, so without this line `git add -A` records it as a
# gitlink pointing at a SHA no remote has, changing every turn, and a fresh clone gets an empty
# directory anyway. Ignoring it also keeps `git add -A` from failing outright in the window
# where the store exists with no commit yet.
.sage/snapshots/
